@startuml reporting-sequence-diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title REPORTING SERVICE - ĐỒNG BỘ GIAO DỊCH VÀ XUẤT BÁO CÁO EXCEL

actor "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "TransactionSyncController" as SyncCtrl
participant "TransactionService" as TxnSvc
participant "TransactionSyncValidator" as Validator
participant "TransactionRepository" as TxnRepo
database "reporting_db" as DB
actor "Brand Admin" as Admin
participant "ExcelExportController" as ExportCtrl
participant "ExcelExportService" as ExportSvc

== PHẦN 1: ĐỒNG BỘ DỮ LIỆU GIAO DỊCH TỪ ORDER SERVICE ==
OrderSvc -> SyncCtrl: POST /internal/v1/reporting/sync/transactions\n{transactionId: "TXN-9001", orderId: 9001, amount: 50000, status: "DISPENSED"}\n(Header: X-Internal-Service-Key)
activate SyncCtrl

SyncCtrl -> SyncCtrl: verifyInternalApiKey(key)
SyncCtrl -> TxnSvc: syncTransaction(request)
activate TxnSvc

TxnSvc -> Validator: validate(request)
activate Validator
Validator --> TxnSvc: OK (Dữ liệu hợp lệ)
deactivate Validator

TxnSvc -> TxnRepo: findByTransactionId("TXN-9001")
activate TxnRepo
TxnRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM transactions WHERE transaction_id = 'TXN-9001'
activate DB
DB --> TxnRepo: Optional.empty (Giao dịch mới)
deactivate DB
TxnRepo --> TxnSvc: null
deactivate TxnRepo

TxnSvc -> TxnRepo: save(Transaction Entity)
activate TxnRepo
TxnRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO transactions (transaction_id, order_id, amount, status, ...)
deactivate TxnRepo

TxnSvc --> SyncCtrl: Saved Transaction Entity
deactivate TxnSvc
SyncCtrl --> OrderSvc: 200 OK {"status": "SYNCED"}
deactivate SyncCtrl

== PHẦN 2: BRAND ADMIN TRUY VẤN VÀ XUẤT FILE BÁO CÁO EXCEL ==
Admin -> ExportCtrl: GET /api/reporting/excel/export?tenantId=1&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-14
activate ExportCtrl

ExportCtrl -> ExportSvc: exportToExcel(tenantId, from, to)
activate ExportSvc

ExportSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM transactions WHERE tenant_id = 1 AND transaction_time BETWEEN ...
activate DB
DB --> ExportSvc: List<Transaction>
deactivate DB

ExportSvc -> ExportSvc: Khởi tạo Apache POI XSSFWorkbook:\n1. Tạo Sheet "Doanh Thu Chi Tiết"\n2. Ghi Header, định dạng tiền tệ VND\n3. Tính tổng SUM(amount) và tỷ lệ thành công\n4. Xuất mảng byte[] (Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats...)

ExportSvc --> ExportCtrl: byte[] Excel File Stream
deactivate ExportSvc
ExportCtrl --> Admin: 200 OK (Download file: BaoCaoDoanhThu_202611.xlsx)
deactivate ExportCtrl

@enduml
